<title>HONG KONG: Allied Banking Corp sets US$50 mln FRCD.</title>
<headline>Allied Banking Corp sets US$50 mln FRCD.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-10-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following issue was announced by arranger Standard Chartered Investment Banking.</p>
<p>BORROWER ALLED BANKING CORP</p>
<p> AMOUNT   US$50 MLN    COUPON    3ML+85	MATURITY  3 YRS</p>
<p> TYPE     FRCD	   ISS PRICE PAR	   LAUNCH    15.OCT.96</p>
<p> PUTS     NONE	   CALLS     NONE	  REPLIES   30.OCT.96</p>
<p> LISTING  NONE	   REPAYMENT BULLET	DENOMS    US$100K</p>
<p> RATINGS  NONE	   SALE LMTS STANDARD    TAX PROV  --</p>
<p> NEG PLG  YES	    CRS DEF   YES	   FORCE MAJ YES</p>
<p> HOME CTRY PHILIPPINES GOV LAW   ENGLISH     PAY DATE  15.NOV.96</p>
<p> NOTES    ISSUED OFF US$150 MLN CD PROGRAM</p>
<p>MGT LEVELS AND FEES</p>
<p>	    CO-LEAD MANAGERS   US$5 MLN   21 BP  ALL-IN 92 BP</p>
<p>	    MANAGERS	     US$2-4 MLN 18 BP  ALL-IN 91 BP</p>
<p>ARRANGER STANDARD CHARTERED INVESTMENT BANKING</p>
<p>C0-ARRGS BANK AUSTRIA SINGAPORE AND KOREA FIRST BANK</p>
<p>--Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2847 4039</p>
</text>
